From 4abca36096a9314cc6a6c847ad7b018723a68474 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seyoon Ragavan <complexzetaprime@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:47:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] The ND inventory API: the nondeterministic model's
 equations for the C1 fill briefs

C1's pre-ship inventory (the user's "Everything" rule, 2026-10-16) found the nondeterministic
counterparts of #118's deterministic API missing. 41 equations, declarations and simps
attributes only (isSimp := false, no @[simp]):

- Nondeterministic: stepWith_of_some (the live ND step, beside stepWith_of_halt), initCfg_eq,
  haltsWithin_iff; the fields of fixChoice, MultiTapeTM.toNDTM, FinTM.toFinNDTM, relabelState
- NTIME: acceptsWithin_iff, decidesInTime_iff, mem_NTIME_iff
- ChoiceReplay: the fields of replayTM and withChoiceTape
- NDCodes: the fields of CodeNDTM.toFinNDTM
- Build/NDHost: the fields of guessRunCfg and streamStartCfg
- Build/StepClock: the fields of clockCfg, and Cfg.stopped_iff

Stacked on #118 (lean/brief-api 531b98a2): its replay closure overlaps.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
