From 85f2c916c697bcb5633de0e98c410312d14c0bd4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seyoon Ragavan <complexzetaprime@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:34:21 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] The ND inventory API, second commit: the hosted
 step-block loop's and Z1's definitions

C1 wave 1's route inventory (R's interpreter core is H2's step block in H1's hosted counter loop,
hosted by Z1; the diagonalizer's top rung runs under Z1's suppressing host). 14 equations,
declarations and simps attributes only (isSimp := false, no @[simp]):

- Build/StepBlock: tableTape_eq, summaryTape_eq, exit_true, exit_false, Rep_iff,
  outputSummary_nil, summaryCells_eq (the definitions hostedLoopTM_run and hostedLoop_read read)
- Build/VirtualInput: vhostCfg's five fields (simps), vhostCap_eq, vhostSilentCfg_eq

Cfg.ofWords's remaining fields wait for the diagonalizer fill's inventory (Simulation would put
311 modules in this replay).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
